# P12 round 7 step 2: the A/B mode of the Synth play page on Tracker+. Shift + Perform opens the page on Synth 1 (part A), Right x4 goes to
# the Synth B column and Up turns part B on (the encoder steps over part A: Synth 2), the pair shares the stock pool of 8 voices as 4 + 4.
# Left x2 goes to Morph and Up steps it from 50 to 55. Pad 12 held plays its note on both parts, the release ends it, Pattern leaves the
# page. plus_flows.sh reads the page state afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_SPLAY, splayLine): open with B on and 4 voices on each side, a held
# cell, none after the release, and the last line closed with the MIDI in mode back. The bank swap with held notes is smoke row 21.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh plus
title: Synth play A/B on Tracker+ (P12)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Shift
wait 300ms
tap Performance
wait 300ms
release Shift
wait 1200ms
expect text "Synth B"
tap Right x4
wait 300ms
tap Up
wait 600ms
tap Left x2
wait 300ms
tap Up
wait 600ms
pad 12 press
wait 500ms
shot ab
pad 12 release
wait 500ms
tap Pattern
wait 1000ms
